","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12"}]},{"sha":"878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDg3OGFiM2UyMGQzNWRlNjMwMDE0NzZkNWU2OGMyOWIxMmZhZDRmMTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T19:47:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T19:47:59Z"},"message":"feat(code): add `multi_select` question type to `ask_user` (#5097)\n\nAdds a `multi_select` question type to the `ask_user` tool so the agent\ncan ask a question where the user selects **multiple** options from a\npredefined list, alongside the existing `text` and `multiple_choice`\ntypes.\n\n---\n\n`multi_select` mirrors `multiple_choice` at the protocol level: it\nrequires a non-empty `choices` list, and the answer is returned as a\nsingle string per question — the selected choice values joined with `\",\n\"`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/32d25bcb-5f07-29c9-f394-503ace2882a6)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/32d25bcb-5f07-29c9-f394-503ace2882a6/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5711b410ac5e255054f1a1885062462e629f4c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5711b410ac5e255054f1a1885062462e629f4c19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg2VvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMFwQABky/cVSjdh1w2kETUvmOdLF\nH6NGS3MM8YAu4z7rxzBmNoi6m2qceHka1bKfBXJje7oTq7fqG3ZR2HwoHW4zWBcH\nUbNtWc+8VSI4HPsqnErCKH2h7Pp1Mvc5zUudS4YHMIuZXQNNr0LB/NV6YltZvCfM\nFtI+a7YncKf+1ifNBRSuZ+EBt9l4ekAz/HEfzXdyDV68UX0XiywmfUaD2Z5WsKE8\nGCu4d1+qgu4GGwY3dUZfOrd1ydyR1QF0GJSXoAb2ZCZRiFEe5rkKGpGHtRl4nRMl\nB6gyTU8bTvyiYuXYZxMByG7VAYX9A8rPsyw40dO6tEknLriDgX721GfHygZAXsCh\naOZeBaN5NiRoroMoZ2KT7/XVQEvw5oaLy79zAG9x3+t9jKNLppXE8GZ4pSYtJoPc\nmpJirf9dWkMBW4crvz1n++XgaGPXTUEtBsYv0hyrl2DNLugM1yAupK0Y1gFgRpJF\nb8A1n4KMf82qkdtOCBSSs7efudQ8gnssfW/jXShy5mJEKCyK+KgqGI3yg698Q8B6\nvkCkUaTNhc2HRsgKOZWZ/EWWeBHugwBn+HfZ6pk+jGyj5DWzIHfaZx7p8xJCBzDe\n+6JJqFlWtn40/AxEix3NgKVa1/vW111r+bwtS3enpco+D+iffgJ+eRvWS7yq1ml2\nYJOKwwo9xwTtdPAO0x/4\n=FzmF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5711b410ac5e255054f1a1885062462e629f4c19\nparent 5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786996079 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786996079 -0400\n\nfeat(code): add `multi_select` question type to `ask_user` (#5097)\n\nAdds a `multi_select` question type to the `ask_user` tool so the agent\ncan ask a question where the user selects **multiple** options from a\npredefined list, alongside the existing `text` and `multiple_choice`\ntypes.\n\n---\n\n`multi_select` mirrors `multiple_choice` at the protocol level: it\nrequires a non-empty `choices` list, and the answer is returned as a\nsingle string per question — the selected choice values joined with `\",\n\"`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/32d25bcb-5f07-29c9-f394-503ace2882a6)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/32d25bcb-5f07-29c9-f394-503ace2882a6/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-17T19:48:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/878ab3e20d35de63001476d5e68c29b12fad4f12/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf"}]},{"sha":"5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDVhYTI2NmVhYjVjYTBhZWRlZTU4MzY3YzYzNTk5YTkyNjg2M2QyY2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T19:45:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T19:45:22Z"},"message":"fix(code): keep chat input responsive during `/reload` (#5529)\n\nTyping in the chat input now remains responsive while `/reload` is\nrunning.\n\n---\n\n`/reload` awaited config, theme, skill, plugin, and hook refreshes\ndirectly on Textual's App message pump, preventing key events from\nreaching the chat input. It now uses the existing detached command\ncontinuation so typing stays live while submissions queue until reload\ncompletes; `/restart` already detaches its respawn for the same reason.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/4d4e920d-44bc-f609-e17c-9abfe8f13eb0)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"20ddcffa78fc68b9488f0004db74ef8e6ce9a561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/20ddcffa78fc68b9488f0004db74ef8e6ce9a561"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg2TTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJxYQAEAcc2GVBGMiOaid55S67+Y9\n+DGxqfrwsc/dhg7+O6EsLFW2+4GID3gttnB5TN3TK9GcTsaKfXpUs77P3zVsjkpM\nOdwpZIVjjCTQfcQ97ROJwSCYPQjrdj6icLM7K1O5TYV3cTbEveMdeC8XSjsNKRXq\npgCyVm/cOznKr9RbpVq1ha62Pum9PAuFCX+qA8PoH0jRlB45hXLF1IKeNB9tNtPU\nDzJaRHf4+qelysxp2wB4nx0PtuKGS7fRv3bYxx4LBASPSK80d5pmq1aj9I46zke6\ny72X5oVCN11jAonYApHxMeDf38D+B8+M/OFpLptbfm87WSWUIgpP22TTGdhC3Dmy\n4+iulEoR8NEo61NliEE4wwzRmlOTvi+KZCUyFHO3XkV5E2pd98A/k2/pbp13MrNT\nGLXHTagq7CN8c7mmWKyJvs66sr+nSYesgbP7mlL9TDpeHmufRjrRxw8issZUXEwX\nIO18ME8eLwqjx8uBmD4Mia8qHIAbwGopW+Yhv0hHaswvFSnkRT/wQhqdoQm1Qnu0\n8YEjTDT373NPHG8QRh80l9FI6VIU7xiZXxCNKJkdYbyA5cRUmMlatsplxWCOzwyj\n+Z87bySdUenMhq4CrLMzhh4QQhtz6fkymHvWWiE7PKFaiO7EQFwKNQR15ipc4+/m\n3aV/CY380zxIjW3LvUEA\n=u6Sg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 20ddcffa78fc68b9488f0004db74ef8e6ce9a561\nparent 4544fac203d786f6087c72f95714331fa3ff4b11\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786995922 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786995922 -0400\n\nfix(code): keep chat input responsive during `/reload` (#5529)\n\nTyping in the chat input now remains responsive while `/reload` is\nrunning.\n\n---\n\n`/reload` awaited config, theme, skill, plugin, and hook refreshes\ndirectly on Textual's App message pump, preventing key events from\nreaching the chat input. It now uses the existing detached command\ncontinuation so typing stays live while submissions queue until reload\ncompletes; `/restart` already detaches its respawn for the same reason.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/4d4e920d-44bc-f609-e17c-9abfe8f13eb0)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-17T19:45:23Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5aa266eab5ca0aedee58367c63599a926863d2cf/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/g