vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3"}]},{"sha":"cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGNmNzU3OGQxYzM0MDNiZGU5NjBhNDNjYmE1MWY1ZGFkN2MzMzZjYjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T18:16:10Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T18:16:10Z"},"message":"fix(code): hide dependency details after updates (#5519)\n\nNormal `/update` output no longer lists every transitive dependency\nchange and instead shows a command for the exact persisted update log.\n\n---\n\nThe updater now allocates a per-operation log path and passes it through\nto the install, matching the existing startup-update convention without\nadding a new slash-command API. Explicit dependency refreshes remain\ndetailed.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/53250091-9fc0-c98e-0296-31e4b1aded04)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"40eca63a030c1921c6e04d27b4ed2da7b7e5e1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/40eca63a030c1921c6e04d27b4ed2da7b7e5e1ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg0/qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6TkQACKD0ROFp18hOnI054FZl9Qi\nwo7dSaD1Lkd+eNr0ztrGeVIWKhpCgSKixm7uNt/fYaUlIswEEagUxkRy+LmhmuXl\naimIiXNR7KciDLbgTWJKFnydNkLSTd5e9fgszIlkGO59plrHl7JwAyqMjT5QI1eL\nBEZg4KIZEEicvU7yRU01GBdzO6+J9JMvfgBpfRxH/8oaeh6m7+Aba5CXcTRApZfg\np1aestXNJi7vQoTWLSGPDh/g8yIU0X9cCiIw2VpUJ2CjygT8FNiNwyamnGhJ7Jbl\nFqg/adoqem5ILhICTZxDKHoEzQC69/AvmFHDsqy/sQzbwn6RuzTtyA8TQaEjwU6r\nlY950s773nZC3C6PzzdXosQ0J4Uid3zO1azAYEEOKxt8vWUeereD0rQrqNCvYe9e\nW+mSuQryOXA/fy9wKvcrXVHdfjZz000Em2wsiLhFsDcrbR2cFkLa07Ua/2cGptWc\nuoab0SYJuNehQKLKTm9ca+zNryRhKfEoHtnHb7Xkqlbn80YxpYPLepzW5iIw2sPt\nHdOiBg2IMZ1bTP86uJ4vKK+5DVF7Os/+JN+Xy/Bnz5nllgjBIreSOpA+GVh9UgiB\n/hDXLVGYZej4zkCu3IHpYrahLpzlJN03v2ON3S2DrTY5E3O02XswQeV7i5xiE78D\nn6Fvp1TLirYAhNcMzl7C\n=E35u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 40eca63a030c1921c6e04d27b4ed2da7b7e5e1ae\nparent f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786990570 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786990570 -0400\n\nfix(code): hide dependency details after updates (#5519)\n\nNormal `/update` output no longer lists every transitive dependency\nchange and instead shows a command for the exact persisted update log.\n\n---\n\nThe updater now allocates a per-operation log path and passes it through\nto the install, matching the existing startup-update convention without\nadding a new slash-command API. Explicit dependency refreshes remain\ndetailed.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/53250091-9fc0-c98e-0296-31e4b1aded04)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-17T18:16:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cf7578d1c3403bde960a43cba51f5dad7c336cb3/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2"}]},{"sha":"f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGYwNDQ2YzhjOGFlY2ZmMjQzNTQ1ZmUwYzU1MWE2NTM5Y2NmNDgyYTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T17:54:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T17:54:59Z"},"message":"fix(code): preserve editables during dependency refresh (#5521)\n\nEditable `dcode` installs can now refresh stale dependencies from the\nstartup prompt without replacing workspace sibling editables with PyPI\nwheels.\n\n---\n\nThe refresh command shares a fixed argv with the in-process runner, adds\nsibling checkouts only when both exist, and rechecks dependency floors\nbefore continuing.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\nFocused dep-floor and picker tests; `make format`; `make lint`.\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9b19b48f-b284-c0a3-e1c5-5bbc5194d48c)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9b19b48f-b284-c0a3-e1c5-5bbc5194d48c/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"569aca71e09cde645f0e0938c330ff9c472d7dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/569aca71e09cde645f0e0938c330ff9c472d7dec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg0rzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABkEQAAIeTUQWvbaeQDPC4upIaMm3\nrVW2DDQlrE2dGwteLQNYCh88Eu8Wew1t0MJL7ivGgOgYufXvCidOqw99aDWRUixL\nlA+333EUBtId3QQ5J109kJjxQm0wygxnYDjN0w2FHvbbfZQjLK60oBTuqJRwP8jG\nhWkAizXhEyh5WCzvGeHUINjyY4eFYVoOcXak8CKXlhnQEkCOzrrmuhckDNKsW5bI\npjFswI1PrpIuTGYOJumcswe6k4AwejhZU1hK9kpkJvKD2EcGz7ZazsUK5dvfoPvC\n1ltTdAxTPrPtm40et6oVryF4WRWyqBZ8JY3uxDSyqviZMR1Ne8PoiUAQdJHSAHeN\nOQzIfgSXWHkvQmkDBouKLuVTLblEZ+rwRNt3CKMi6ZxOikBHKJi8CUVOPCtdwZ3F\nPzDRsV7UjQPUi+qu8W32t5CXIIPvDLAS6MbBsP1XV6pKsgJ9xzM0Del7JP5J6DpL\nlLMiGJaq9s7kZ5tTINpbf2ER9KAuCkbQv74aDyNGA35OQx3nCHSSM59cwl6KX6fB\nihMVNkIHbP2Yw3lChSLhp9MsIZ73QnaWkDXqZeaQLScSFBD7HbibFMM2MsFf3reh\nVNfG9wlrRlto9rkISmeFF77jQwuZu9e50/Q7ZKzFLqvPLUXFIgyxE/02+nFbcbj3\n59pLlxUgztk/QvopRaAO\n=sW9N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 569aca71e09cde645f0e0938c330ff9c472d7dec\nparent 7772a1495440739130b8b613aa69433fbc0afbad\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786989299 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786989299 -0400\n\nfix(code): preserve editables during dependency refresh (#5521)\n\nEditable `dcode` installs can now refresh stale dependencies from the\nstartup prompt without replacing workspace sibling editables with PyPI\nwheels.\n\n---\n\nThe refresh command shares a fixed argv with the in-process runner, adds\nsibling checkouts only when both exist, and rechecks dependency floors\nbefore continuing.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\nFocused dep-floor and picker tests; `make format`; `make lint`.\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9b19b48f-b284-c0a3-e1c5-5bbc5194d48c)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9b19b48f-b284-c0a3-e1c5-5bbc5194d48c/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-17T17:54:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f0446c8c8aecff243545fe0c551a6539ccf482a2/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","followin