,"email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T16:54:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T16:54:24Z"},"message":"feat(code): support ACP approval modes (#5394)\n\n`dcode --acp` now supports classifier-backed Auto with `--auto-approve`\nand unrestricted execution with `--yolo` after the existing\nacknowledgement.\n\n---\n\nAuto receives per-session control state and literal ACP prompt metadata\nwhile keeping protocol stdout clean.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/01a0017f-67f2-7706-95ce-13e329c14547)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"25d796b4b5fafcc64adb91331761c4404f001c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/25d796b4b5fafcc64adb91331761c4404f001c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7772a1495440739130b8b613aa69433fbc0afbad","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgzzACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEpEQACtN1CbJ4eXwznHub9qXBkKz\nspCRn3DN/kMzWgx8Vt6/dAiANAifQO86RBayMaYyxgIc2YUa50L+Fl4qRU9VqoCW\npq9NkW8nwxvLrIodsv8oAbyGsNfGYzbl7fYzXT7n10pR7UfseZRH+mNC4ZRRvQXa\nXKdrIp1Q+E7SoBvFpuzjvP4CJLDqjVyqSMtjupzu0pAW0C3pVrqE+ALRT0DOIw5M\nB6WAqtsrm7TcgwpXc5vhUCLHEcjN7jclHOK8/jPfOOYQkz8mhqWQeKZQ3q7XhPnT\nqzI8T/AHDHUr5I3zhcNQay3Xm4/gouFdtGloc0TkofJrRwXFekFTirU3u/JwrI6C\nDSpIi+oA8oVfIbbBG9wrqfszx2/OFBiSzQRSPt09WcFY1VugVCjc3nDslLukVw5z\ns3TsavyCpRfbv6PwV5U6+TCx6+q+vIHcHM2AeFp8FgRgxjGDO/QhlIj+IRqT2Q7H\nq7B6h0AwO9xW+g+iQJiT2ThOA3bqMNfQwgfxdF6HY5teoWuknq0izQCM1qxDuYTh\njnsb2usnlkbQdpBz0YSexzYJh9LjG39GcTum233rxjpGYB8+g8wIoThvzpBxVL6S\nKjH7lQdkXEvbnTx8bMSNtQ60Ak80JatEqhhw65bWR9GjKROO8c/EjL6cd5JyeB/v\nTQz3iphGe7PqU116eYq5\n=pX3M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 25d796b4b5fafcc64adb91331761c4404f001c17\nparent b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1786985664 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786985664 -0700\n\nfeat(code): support ACP approval modes (#5394)\n\n`dcode --acp` now supports classifier-backed Auto with `--auto-approve`\nand unrestricted execution with `--yolo` after the existing\nacknowledgement.\n\n---\n\nAuto receives per-session control state and literal ACP prompt metadata\nwhile keeping protocol stdout clean.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/01a0017f-67f2-7706-95ce-13e329c14547)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-17T16:54:24Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7772a1495440739130b8b613aa69433fbc0afbad","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7772a1495440739130b8b613aa69433fbc0afbad","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7772a1495440739130b8b613aa69433fbc0afbad/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce"}]},{"sha":"b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI5ZmE0YjZjZTU2MDNjOWMzZTY1YzMzMWI0NDgwYTk3OWRlNDFkY2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T07:17:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T07:17:43Z"},"message":"style(code): restore active-question side line for multi-question `ask_user` menus (#5539)\n\nMulti-question `ask_user` prompts again show a green line on the left\nside of the active question. Single-question prompts do not change: no\nnumber, no line.\n\n---\n\nPR #5444 removed this line from all prompts. With two or more questions,\nonly a `>` marker and dimmed text showed which question was active.\nThese signs were hard to see.\n\nThis change adds the class `ask-user-menu-multi` to prompts that have\nmore than one question. The CSS shows the line only when this class is\npresent:\n\n- The active question gets the line and `padding-left: 1`.\n- The inactive questions get `padding-left: 2`.\n\nThe line is one column wide, so active and inactive questions have the\nsame total left space. The text stays in position when the active\nquestion changes.","tree":{"sha":"24e2ff1f89e0fcb439d4ed233acaea1c7c0feb34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/24e2ff1f89e0fcb439d4ed233acaea1c7c0feb34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgrWXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5x8QAKgVoIU4O3afjnZPlu1Mb768\nS8Wc52iikSY9bu5yG35xQTxCf3YwdGq4ctLPj+Q3AiVijf7quryWW0AY0stDQibH\n3/Y7EJSQt3GMAemq+vzfVq9nHiuCoSdjjLmSZuGJy+l7wmJbGR5PLTe8wvBsnXhW\nHbihaXgkkkVNnVyrcDE97NZBSd0Bfm876srnL2Dg9JYlGckn2wiEdrm/tQKX1IRC\nLKSp+lVAE1S8c+slbFfIlAh4u8ygg/yXpjK9XRFiBgdtLUqUODPfsRoTYEP5a2G9\nWFvz39fRZUGCGM5em9Kgw0F3+tdO56sDfWiO+7Q2/UvRQldlUUoUG88pAb9Pamtb\nvAl0NVIqSjqMT/2LNSIAlmWf7v14FHhnp6d2RH+VE3Ai6vto3pp+LKdY8tR4XdF+\naoHqKkyDZFXKsFVaDdnNYM7ABll66h1N1et7lSV5QN++R1jwCUMuY37n3PtLCR6f\n62FQb9XGHUE3tvKXHostTYIit/pki4cVeqVlVZCnglJxr5hd7WgSrye55Yk6H87w\n0gawpNYqYgI4EdjDCJGdamAMwJUwAKZs3nEjnACfKwo2dRYdD9/TL6wzasW57OQM\nsACwGwAu+ZJUzQTZCOqrJoGfwrLrBk7yeG0OF304AzJELdBcvc6wzZvznVoPYsdj\nml2b6E2rmMrZts8xocsM\n=iUQG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 24e2ff1f89e0fcb439d4ed233acaea1c7c0feb34\nparent c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786951063 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786951063 -0400\n\nstyle(code): restore active-question side line for multi-question `ask_user` menus (#5539)\n\nMulti-question `ask_user` prompts again show a green line on the left\nside of the active question. Single-question prompts do not change: no\nnumber, no line.\n\n---\n\nPR #5444 removed this line from all prompts. With two or more questions,\nonly a `>` marker and dimmed text showed which question was active.\nThese signs were hard to see.\n\nThis change adds the class `ask-user-menu-multi` to prompts that have\nmore than one question. The CSS shows the line only when this class is\npresent:\n\n- The active question gets the line and `padding-left: 1`.\n- The inactive questions get `padding-left: 2`.\n\nThe line is one column wide, so active and inactive questions have the\nsame total left space. The text stays in position when the active\nquestion changes.","verified_at":"2026-08-17T07:17:44Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b9fa4b6ce5603c9c3e65c331b4480a979de41dce/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5"}]},{"sha":"c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGMyZWM1ZTZkOWY4NWJmMTE0YTM2NjZiYmE5ODJkZTBjNjNlYzVlYjU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-17T06:17:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-17T06:17:29Z"},"message":"fix(code): refresh splash version after update (#5520)\n\nThe splash header now reflects the newly installed dcode version\nimmediately after successful in-session updates.\n\n---\n\nThe banner previously read only the running process's baked-in version,\nleaving the old value visible until relaunch. Both slash-command and\nnotification installs now refresh it only after a successful,\nnon-shadowed upgrade.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/52dccf6f-be51-fd9e-c81c-4f2ea5d3f541)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b5d6542e859fa0cdbbbad21e80c7f0df04ebaaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9b5d6542e859fa0cdbbbad21e80c7f0df04ebaaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c2ec5e6d9f85bf114a3666bba982de0c63ec5eb5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgqd5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUngQAFRYcDKadULBbidEebmWXCrm\nvgkOoTQNs2MYCtDGV1u2vyk29xk/E06ZzCh3uXx9q7w52f9jEPOl2CQCYdAp8MRp\nJzj/meYjP2fNP6UUg0NdXSFrxOqJ3Tes0MDw0y/w5OrbcS8s3h6GRLXb2Li65t8d\nRp52sjeNtKrikpTpwrMbmbydhJspweLVjLjNpJralY/mrZ0CoYfEzUNPMIETcMCN\nuvVXkierd7NsKei+X5WcISSW8TUW8aAuwPS6rxoosR5hWvRIgf2rZOHlKMbRbZTp\nqnyLjVP7p5QKN+vJf7iWkqDWP89ZC/iIriTA5TNmrMRQK0ELcgbHU8qf11Gi3+vL\ncIkz1SA7XKoi+Qc0Yw/+tzco+IXLnrRXU3+f8lLYd/WHa9QLHx/2uUwXqziMAaPp\nWYQVFMSNoPUamx9oCNa34UdJ2fBT1d2ZIC581707tfqqUezXCFeZCBZLkd2jEGaf\nybvxgQbYfJMQGti/v3EfiqUhDBHY0XGz11xh2kyOHBcTUrP0JC+A9BnNkwDpe3X5\nksssw2QyPJ/DLR9B4Y7lmv6rb4Ng80SVWPHDXKJ1Vxkw+KvsYg9qNn25mpJSttBx\nduErgeoLlN31ISuFfUZfBSiZs80CWO4cjdTewSoTlbk1U/25lNzulWucpdPBgU+x\no4o2698BnMSl1F7HylRx\n=rbYl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9b5d6542e859fa0cdbbbad21e80c7f0df04ebaaa\nparent 59ae459691e67af65ed5dd299817781b6ee36152\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786947449 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786947449 -0400\n\nfix(code): refresh splash version after update (#5520)\n\nThe splash header now reflects the newly installed dcode version\nimmediately after successful in-session updates.\n\n---\n\nThe banner previously read only the running process's baked-in version,\nleaving the old value visible until relaunch. Both slash-command and\nnotification installs now refresh it only after a successful,\nnon-shadowed upgrade.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/52dccf6f-be51-fd9e-c81c-4f2ea5d3f541)\n\