langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a38dc4297b225e424207df5efd7dec0cf38ce832","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a38dc4297b225e424207df5efd7dec0cf38ce832","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a38dc4297b225e424207df5efd7dec0cf38ce832/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1"}]},{"sha":"ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGFiMDhiZGM3ZjJkZmQzMTdjNTYzZDRmZTcyY2MzMDZhYzIzYTMwYTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-14T18:19:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-14T18:19:41Z"},"message":"ci(infra): re-lock after raising `genai-prices` floor in bump workflow (#5514)\n\nA bot opens a daily PR to bump `genai-prices` in `libs/code`. Those PRs\nwere failing CI (see #5511).\n\nThe bot updates two files that must agree: `pyproject.toml` (the allowed\nversion range) and `uv.lock` (the exact pinned version, which also\nrecords that range). It was re-generating the lockfile *before* raising\nthe range in `pyproject.toml`, then never re-generating it after. So the\ncommitted lockfile still recorded the old range, CI's \"lockfile is in\nsync\" check saw the mismatch, and the PR failed.\n\n---\n\nThe fix adds one more lockfile regeneration after the range bump, so the\ntwo files agree. Verified locally: the sync check now passes.","tree":{"sha":"9a1075103fbe28608740c48b0f8f87050d5fcc1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9a1075103fbe28608740c48b0f8f87050d5fcc1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqf1w9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnmUQAJPA0M1tZqcx2FAp3sOwI1Dd\nLHTVTN3/i60W6IPcZ7trci5AaaKTeyMA2r4M83i1g3ri5za+bDCkehhwaYa7BqT/\n/uR3M7RGU7bSr0NNV3SEtqJ0FiX0RfCghan0m4MyilCXxoVKKzuN3SDNhcGV5lF/\nIu9kKIQ276EcOR2IP2+FrPBx/rZ/Y83o1ZWM3hp0Jb+rLwT47z40o0UZSC5iKAVB\ns0f/SHZT+sXGqnsTuxnIYGnZkcIQFt1gPfN7bc/y+3DmnX22sYBjOkKUCMb/cT1l\nGBGBupLDDcv98O+fb1H3zpzzW1hbMQSDS3DDyqcz9FQKmmS3+UtfB26jeg4ZCyiC\nb6QKYVv0mJp1F6kNKviTrAQgMpKgeUdG67YEphoycX821AWYff/xpW4TtP6666Lb\nSQOk2tMj2NdMPfqW30ldPXD+zq2z3TShyX2oMYzjqh8695T7WxYkyX8U+ErU5WQR\n0kcq1PVQ3hMiq+EtiuAr2JgzEond9k03EmiSZiTHjbJ6c6Jv3TCpXVTaOkL8NaW8\n4oCznx69KBRWARdgU0VbN1tK5yD3eEPsjtP5zYULBD6Z1FeP7cQac7EJ2qxYMmbi\nxWWOnRO8OeShVT9iROzVuuiV24rHv2iAjPTOQvYuOrquFMfnqR3DBaB+hWIXysFd\nfdRtGn4uat0oMyQs2SqF\n=ewLT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9a1075103fbe28608740c48b0f8f87050d5fcc1b\nparent cd762dd4e27ab131d70cd7b0e6e3eb43e17f9de0\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786731581 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786731581 -0700\n\nci(infra): re-lock after raising `genai-prices` floor in bump workflow (#5514)\n\nA bot opens a daily PR to bump `genai-prices` in `libs/code`. Those PRs\nwere failing CI (see #5511).\n\nThe bot updates two files that must agree: `pyproject.toml` (the allowed\nversion range) and `uv.lock` (the exact pinned version, which also\nrecords that range). It was re-generating the lockfile *before* raising\nthe range in `pyproject.toml`, then never re-generating it after. So the\ncommitted lockfile still recorded the old range, CI's \"lockfile is in\nsync\" check saw the mismatch, and the PR failed.\n\n---\n\nThe fix adds one more lockfile regeneration after the range bump, so the\ntwo files agree. Verified locally: the sync check now passes.","verified_at":"2026-08-14T18:19:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ab08bdc7f2dfd317c563d4fe72cc306ac23a30a1"