:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769"}]},{"sha":"822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDgyMmY3YzliMDJlNmQ5OWJkYjQ2YjU1NDViYjI1NDM3ODNjMDE3Njk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Caspar Broekhuizen","email":"caspar@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T22:54:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T22:54:26Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): batch concurrent `ContextHubBackend` mutations (#5471)\n\nContextHubBackend now preserves concurrent file mutations in one durable\ncommit and retains compatible remote changes during conflict recovery.\n\n---\n\nConcurrent callers previously reused the same parent commit, causing\n409s. Retries could also replay stale edit or recursive-delete payloads.\n\nMutations now coalesce for 50 ms into serialized multi-file commits.\nConflict recovery replays ordered intent against refreshed state;\nexplicit writes remain last-writer-wins.","tree":{"sha":"6466fbf1d53dc3559e62af9150827ba1be2756a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6466fbf1d53dc3559e62af9150827ba1be2756a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfksiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA87sQACAjpLg1J/pcsTrbrg/4HiQK\ngILE2ttfVfYxV/FmTOgDy8wB/LpNl2af8yayIOXcb9Pt9vgw7jp80JRP9FsAwUGj\nfgr8zemw8sMLtNrD5PujNUBqCB5dEYRY3JkKLV4Fdhc/yej/4Z3azQwi2N33DCFo\nnYxu/JaZ330rj3Cjp1p6oRrSHdFJJpPhKi4GAM8KzXFzGgxOYo0wNHuTTD4ffOM+\nAc6QK/1BQ0xh90cWkPCCnwnYg8Ver77xq0rlCfOKJXLoiH1Iy3IX16iyv02cFghz\nwF3ng83sZM3QD8l4voUPcMsvRMHSlSEOrSon4H7WfZ46vn5nlxuOhYMFytdt8Ws/\n1AshCLWjsUbB4zP/v11jKKTSR579CYFOI3O8XcRNAkNTbfJ/AXfReEPCPNDlyokz\nsmLbOiqccdGpJ+qAhimjLJZRO6NJtYGBoBTsp8uNoAc5xeevoWKp13QJrUur25bN\nDxWXNhdjF/rAZvYme2YwhS3c9N4x3diDXRX1s2jaERfgOBeyw9vE51CY5ugpjZbk\naD7QED+4/FH/ORgt83LxcJ4cDo2wXFtSmjA5MzH3OCbYSMraYRwZhwbyXOzR7b5f\nOwvO/pTOAtkNI5hf3TmElMhPZItRsdRT2vHMcLjthRyoLHDGPJMeBpU0IU5VJ19g\nYDBda+euRhgkbTNH/CNj\n=/hNb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6466fbf1d53dc3559e62af9150827ba1be2756a0\nparent f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d\nauthor Caspar Broekhuizen <caspar@langchain.dev> 1786661666 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786661666 -0700\n\nfix(sdk): batch concurrent `ContextHubBackend` mutations (#5471)\n\nContextHubBackend now preserves concurrent file mutations in one durable\ncommit and retains compatible remote changes during conflict recovery.\n\n---\n\nConcurrent callers previously reused the same parent commit, causing\n409s. Retries could also replay stale edit or recursive-delete payloads.\n\nMutations now coalesce for 50 ms into serialized multi-file commits.\nConflict recovery replays ordered intent against refreshed state;\nexplicit writes remain last-writer-wins.","verified_at":"2026-08-13T22:54:30Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/822f7c9b02e6d99bdb46b5545bb2543783c01769/comments","author":{"login":"casparb","id":25157475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTU3NDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25157475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb","html_url":"https://github.com/casparb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casparb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d"}]},{"sha":"f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGYyYjUyYTVjMGYxNDM1MTRlODU0NGRiZjlmOGYzOTAyMDVlMDgwMGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T20:59:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T20:59:03Z"},"message":"ci(infra): tolerate Code SDK pin bump dispatch failures after publish (#5496)\n\nA release run no longer fails when the post-publish Code SDK pin bump\ndispatch does.\n\n---\n\nThe `bump-code-sdk-pin` job runs after PyPI publish and the GitHub\nrelease tag have both succeeded, so by that point the release has\nalready shipped. The pin-bump PR it kicks off is a convenience that can\nalways be opened by dispatching `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml` manually, so a\ndispatch hiccup should never mark an otherwise-successful release run\nfailed — as happened on the [0.7.6\nrun](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31741867100/job/94587711541).\n\nMarks the dispatch step `continue-on-error: true` and records why in a\ncomment.","tree":{"sha":"f76271fb598a5307f6aac73bba03b755607fb39f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f76271fb598a5307f6aac73bba03b755607fb39f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfjAXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoyQQAEYRQKNaKS/i+3bZd5x8apCX\nl6FqOCENfc2vNtaqZU9DlT7wIFlR25N9+bgwoLEaFr56pyCf9N0zB0I0wqBtblHC\nDCrpsVsMFkwf9CiZFl2seQmi6BzPanjUHthLiRNOlAy19HRETRjqiIxbS3hBoLo5\nUTa7Y2J36JBwqcGNbEvp7WtxtonzQ6Aecnlmjueb2MwLI5dtHY8lvuHo/LUJKfFx\ni64I1y5nWx67t7PwZ4HooP65xsCS4u65Jt4w0/mkO+qpQCG3tNzXWjuqFH6UpIB9\n+DWFizfNTj/2UmZQYzorBzYo/ZZUf52fWfsEswX53I0Qps4QBhKjKzTsUnki/89n\nlOSXNIMhL5Kvi+LR9HC6Q4jjLAwaeho/exZYSiV6R09mQYmMpFx3iAMXQ0Ej/0NO\nO2S8lLTdFyCg1Ik0imYfUQdQVy+poAPXS9XwIH+cvkuMXfi+GIKDTVXdFVIZ5eEo\nYfx7INm+GQSeso9bq5uoA7JODYRvkzXznTh3hGiqek4+RUGRB6v2g7PLRiUaKDLp\nWzN/LxK1ah7Vk1nN4fMYflhTJsgtYtqhwfYzzm1SvlvzIOubFZKdaLbMiGxMl7pR\nUMkCC8o6mRDBf6N54b1Z+IgrmTdZ8IgYej3AI+p1D95CfA20nkIzXEgSDV5I0fnD\norTI+swcA8XKHrfYpshN\n=Q9zO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f76271fb598a5307f6aac73bba03b755607fb39f\nparent 8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786654743 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786654743 -0700\n\nci(infra): tolerate Code SDK pin bump dispatch failures after publish (#5496)\n\nA release run no longer fails when the post-publish Code SDK pin bump\ndispatch does.\n\n---\n\nThe `bump-code-sdk-pin` job runs after PyPI publish and the GitHub\nrelease tag have both succeeded, so by that point the release has\nalready shipped. The pin-bump PR it kicks off is a convenience that can\nalways be opened by dispatching `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml` manually, so a\ndispatch hiccup should never mark an otherwise-successful release run\nfailed — as happened on the [0.7.6\nrun](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31741867100/job/94587711541).\n\nMarks the dispatch step `continue-on-error: true` and records why in a\ncomment.","verified_at":"2026-08-13T20:59:06Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f2b52a5c0f143514e8544dbf9f8f390205e0800d/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b"}]},{"sha":"8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDhmNjQ1YmQ3N2RjMjBkNzY1MjA0NGIwNWRiYTBmMTA4M2ZjY2VkM2I","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T20:54:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T20:54:40Z"},"message":"ci(infra): pass `--repo` to pin-bump dispatch so it works without checkout (#5497)\n\nThe `deepagents` release pipeline now passes `--repo\n\"${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}\"` when dispatching `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml`, so the\nfinal release job no longer fails after a successful publish.\n\n---\n\nThe `bump-code-sdk-pin` job in `release.yml` deliberately skips\n`actions/checkout` — it only needs the GitHub API. But `gh workflow run`\nwas invoked without `-R/--repo`, so `gh` fell back to resolving the\nrepository by shelling out to `git`, which fails in a workspace with no\ncheckout:\n\n```\nfailed to run git: fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git\n```\n\nThis made the last job of the `deepagents` 0.7.6 release ([run\n31741867100](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31741867100))\nreport a failure even though the package had already published to PyPI\nand the GitHub release was tagged. The pin-bump dispatch never fired, so\nthe `chore(deps):` pin PR for 0.7.6 was never opened.\n\nThe fix passes `--repo \"${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}\"` explicitly, which\nresolves to the repo running the workflow. A comment records why the\nflag is there so a future cleanup doesn't \"simplify\" it away.","tree":{"sha":"604b80fdb3f984d351cee8d0036ee10fdcd6c497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/604b80fdb3f984d351cee8d0036ee10fdcd6c497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfi8QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIMIQAKRZ1apMHviuxYnxjMFqDfih\nDflO3kBqtwkaTQN+PLSHistSqwB2AKPWjdJ5qs2zj/baz9hlUF7oTwPUG6LUAMd+\nNJy8aCNHZzutHOJAmlG/w9HeeVHATujqLbMYTXzudD9VnFcMPiU/61RvMPhRHEcQ\ntLV2qIaTZDk3Zp+raArKM6FEkJSOtZ8iLtSV5LoJpJtwSQX1lDptMdM+UcPrSeYP\ncBbg5msl2sit15jTkF9DAsAxDiZfZqrVZ5DVYEPKC3ulAFWuo/UcWKWQ0PtujxXG\nuw1Nt8gJHppDDYK4x0iExTZd9BJGe7+C608kZENVieRZJtnO0YsxKAHuumhTXzQC\nyBPJhJpgAWDVO5h00N0tjwdn8ctuNfBHe40MruReh8pAyGFYzwxEfFTIBbUGEPnU\nCP/15KyOrjAXLfhwO5RAlzFQvSDHIyReor6OBhrXBMlLeL4vQXASbjjja54plTyA\ncCtM8Gr6NHqJdCl0ywVJW+5pC4ZBw3UW0DTpXEKR9ZdD9YDUkIYiyPw6ZOrF9uyt\nZs/wBXabqYiL/rnCGO0l1kHaUqM60ForaLHwQKUZO3EOHktremuD3N1EVM84ndEm\nZMpRK8fZfcCVdrkGDWYOaer7hT+1421JuyjTJVUi9OhvAtalp3NW7ECN/2/deADS\ntIZ6VmTcl1F+3YtBIyq1\n=9fy2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 604b80fdb3f984d351cee8d0036ee10fdcd6c497\nparent 8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786654480 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786654480 -0700\n\nci(infra): pass `--repo` to pin-bump dispatch so it works without checkout (#5497)\n\nThe `deepagents` release pipeline now passes `--repo\n\"${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}\"` when dispatching `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml`, so the\nfinal release job no longer fails after a successful publish.\n\n---\n\nThe `bump-code-sdk-pin` job in `release.yml` deliberately skips\n`actions/checkout` — it only needs the GitHub API. But `gh workflow run`\nwas invoked without `-R/--repo`, so `gh` fell back to resolving the\nrepository by shelling out to `git`, which fails in a workspace with no\ncheckout:\n\n```\nfailed to run git: fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git\n```\n\nThis made the last job of the `deepagents` 0.7.6 release ([run\n31741867100](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31741867100))\nreport a failure even though the package had already published to PyPI\nand the GitHub release was tagged. The pin-bump dispatch never fired, so\nthe `chore(deps):` pin PR for 0.7.6 was never opened.\n\nThe fix passes `--repo \"${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}\"` explicitly, which\nresolves to the repo running the workflow. A comment records why the\nflag is there so a future cleanup doesn't \"simplify\" it away.","verified_at":"2026-08-13T20:54:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8f645bd77dc20d7652044b05dba0f1083fcced3b/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598"}]},{"sha":"8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDhlYjM1ZjYxZDQ0YmFhZjJkNWEyYjQwOWIxODhiOWMxOGQzMGY1OTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","email":"248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-13T20:53:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T20:53:14Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump deepagents pin in deepagents-code to 0.7.6 (#5495)\n\nBumps the exact `deepagents` pin in `libs/code/pyproject.toml` from\n`0.7.5` to `0.7.6` (current workspace SDK version) and regenerates\n`libs/code/uv.lock`.\n\nOpened automatically by `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml` after a commit on `main`\nchanged the SDK version. Merge this before the next `deepagents-code`\nrelease so the SDK pin check goes green.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ea125744a9a46b7fd97ef197146521cc0622735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6ea125744a9a46b7fd97ef197146521cc0622735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfi66CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPqAQABCUA70GpvrQp2oLcvMsbb12\nGKOAjhmBtcgbz8LF4VwWrCr83u7+P+MLmUkGL7TCiSFbRb/2hLetUDoEmGZbo8+L\noS1bXTWhhYbGlk/9muj0O5HOt8VS4DWDcJT2vxYKnsap2fJk0jsWZI+dWhoLGCdN\nQJS0Iyd7mmoLp43bt2/tZuD25HfI9zMJPwxKi326fDrqVkzU3EMC+Lk1zbGm2SEp\np1kcQrvYAuj3lkw7sX0zpWVz8MJzl26Hbt2rLs7LXQXlPVVhVeZYPIYRnJ8tCdQu\nioYsiYzDNXi3ltrmUFa3v4Pggc1anNnt1pY381tO6xCWZvX79pvXiQfF3YCbTx8t\nOwM5s42p85hFlbzeLGAWXnIKkBSXCDlww4s8rbWvOzMxIYYfXFfq/QDk/Yf5Nbkw\n79jU+/EpAxznfxllxNoKGchknyyUoQKLtVghr4HQxU96dQgqogbnVUSEM+QbqGul\njM7AlfKCrIGSQ+8A1h2NSDDPTRMgwRLa2TlGOJn1HIQePAGugelBwk92L0f7NxK7\nFD7xcbIddgKfljqle/u4jYgGbx39YoKV6DSR6Qp8vxdn0bN+4bbvo4Vpi1GblIKM\nHoNWvjqHZ12imWP8ADhw8MliFqwGX+nC2k7+yBTm6EX2DiYL0c/kW5Vqitv7k5OB\nqRbnf5onGcU7OQ/cW+JN\n=Gici\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6ea125744a9a46b7fd97ef197146521cc0622735\nparent edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04\nauthor langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786654394 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786654394 -0700\n\nchore(deps): bump deepagents pin in deepagents-code to 0.7.6 (#5495)\n\nBumps the exact `deepagents` pin in `libs/code/pyproject.toml` from\n`0.7.5` to `0.7.6` (current workspace SDK version) and regenerates\n`libs/code/uv.lock`.\n\nOpened automatically by `bump_code_sdk_pin.yml` after a commit on `main`\nchanged the SDK version. Merge this before the next `deepagents-code`\nrelease so the SDK pin check goes green.\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-13T20:53:17Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8eb35f61d44baaf2d5a2b409b188b9c18d30f598/comments","author":{"login":"langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]","id":248757908,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODtO-lA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2441712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/langchain-oss-automated-triage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langchain-oss-automated-triage%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04"}]},{"sha":"edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGVkZDhiZjRlZmFhZWQ0YzUzNDJlM2JhM2RkMjU4NDliYzY5MzhmMDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T20:46:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T20:46:21Z"},"message":"ci(infra): add SDK path filter edge for all editable-install packages (#5494)\n\nThe `code`, `evals`, and all five partner path filters in `ci.yml` were\nmissing `libs/deepagents/**`, so an SDK-only PR could merge green while\nbreaking packages that editable-install the SDK. This happened with\n#5470: it changed SDK-internal signatures used by `deepagents_code`, but\nno `code` job ran — the failure only surfaced on `main`.\n\nAdds `libs/deepagents/**` to those filters, matching what `cli`, `acp`,\nand `talon` already had, plus a comment stating the rule.","tree":{"sha":"20450513881127aa26cab95dbf1ed9e6b3552793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/20450513881127aa26cab95dbf1ed9e6b3552793"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfi0dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzEgQAHEsLAnFluIeBTh5EyV7ngIw\nm8wLiAXmJTZ1ZwlVgZpRv8oungigcP6W3UdXJUPPDcCDEDAdYT79K+LorFPCZxiU\n57e9IsHxi8jX+GKQC33TtRFoYkWtsRmk5ysz03j+x1RUU0Tc8c7HJrPDPpqo2fDQ\n1bVG0srY3wVnErqAQvwpI6xmNc/OOPfd8j2Fb7bquO8h1SNRrc/CTmg41SnkrNRc\n4U1+UqSWTin65eCXnBe5/OBOabHRWcO26n6cpHiIxk2yr9l87V31imYJ1ml5Q3E+\ndN3j4enbwDo9lvbU8iH0xKBs2gzBGE6jyC64mPcVMtbJlwSGZNm4hL4EF4uR9hg/\n+nl/LUU0yfAaf56TBeZIhc2Y8fKbl43QkNDwXHlXXcD5mQcK6oFqtYpo7kwGSOOw\nhmyPBB16hIHWRfvL2GbTpQKZafM9L48k53bGlMf5yVRLmjXtrxAC65+MIgg9as9L\nj5geWYHtMJrBXOLf8P34DB8LwhOoBLxDL3d9CKEdMeXWMw8uinROgHeLpD1XQsdm\nH6m8JHl0pTzRGt1mzdaR6oQ9r+f/3vTI7s+n9XKrBRV2jX5YpuCF7sN84u0D5PdS\nbu3GbVmjStdknwckmT+VUFYDTrJ3238GOXdSubPoXFPBAg1s7CcWshpsgbnJRG6t\nxEaOZbIOfjdvK2NQVtyF\n=uprD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 20450513881127aa26cab95dbf1ed9e6b3552793\nparent 3afad63e2290559c36a1c386ab2ac9a2d1f8b64a\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786653981 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786653981 -0700\n\nci(infra): add SDK path filter edge for all editable-install packages (#5494)\n\nThe `code`, `evals`, and all five partner path filters in `ci.yml` were\nmissing `libs/deepagents/**`, so an SDK-only PR could merge green while\nbreaking packages that editable-install the SDK. This happened with\n#5470: it changed SDK-internal signatures used by `deepagents_code`, but\nno `code` job ran — the failure only surfaced on `main`.\n\nAdds `libs/deepagents/**` to those filters, matching what `cli`, `acp`,\nand `talon` already had, plus a comment stating the rule.","verified_at":"2026-08-13T20:46:25Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/edd8bf4efaaed4c5342e3ba3dd25849bc6938f04/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub