/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/31e49418c7538542ff30b2701cf8ac9d1182bbeb","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/31e49418c7538542ff30b2701cf8ac9d1182bbeb"}]},{"sha":"31e49418c7538542ff30b2701cf8ac9d1182bbeb","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDMxZTQ5NDE4Yzc1Mzg1NDJmZjMwYjI3MDFjZjhhYzlkMTE4MmJiZWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T19:24:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T19:24:58Z"},"message":"fix(code): clarify dependency warning prompt (#5489)\n\nDependency-floor mismatch prompts now separate guidance and actions with\nblank lines and clearly label the persistent choice as “Continue and\nhide until versions change.”\n\n---\n\nThe previous screen was visually dense, and “mute” did not explain that\nsuppression ends when the stale versions change. Regression coverage\npins both the spacing and approved label.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/a44e5aca-7dfa-c63d-bba8-19b1d4c3365c)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e97e2f1dc1ed664074add53ee0a804ce12360ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/2e97e2f1dc1ed664074add53ee0a804ce12360ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/31e49418c7538542ff30b2701cf8ac9d1182bbeb","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfhoKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY/oQAAYfed0W92ayuPKS7ajFj7tK\n+SoyiRqwNKzL9P1RgAjL/zXu0rMyuPHUg5VjuFX5Gby36yWjNlHu3z+kAnlO0OTu\n7t68Vlbr9qwYf8ObU4oSglIVJzQstg+ZH9j0Nd4/3XQgTccAtdc6C6JYzY8ljyEm\n+urTUIFYIP5+sKU0VPg8TEb5aXAZoNLKGH20O9H/C22uLAO/7IFCHrBOhjBzFO2O\n6+DsOtwXU20rNLduQyMCXdr4vorf7gSVh6wIaR/FzVDfT5ooozCTktH4YEkyw2rL\nL20QlWO+2ATyL1DK77+TeMLEcvBYDiBjAfsCbmdnsUin5TKaeitpF0MQr8mNpiRp\nLUbMtpKO/UIIiPIt4sAGCebY+8Ides9feNPdEbN2Ke2HZwbz9kq1mH/KUnEgAucM\nFShEmx5/ha9FiyIlj34