sion package, so runs\nnever pick up index updates.","tree":{"sha":"fe0ce18ef607f7d5ee27ede8cb069e154da74b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/fe0ce18ef607f7d5ee27ede8cb069e154da74b43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/8d4cabc23585bc35fb10da9049c150e3e35e460e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfcKaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJn8QAEyGQ/ULYopTGPxdDB3IuALQ\nI3wRn1duXbsJCk0l7ymg0xSxwtxukXiFpOjlD+DCmQStgo9gNAkvZH9vLmN8LDZw\nihrQHGJtqoYU0gD7rzbgLE5nNbVTvvh53iSEEHlzLvdktGRvlXJCEBtao8YrPyAk\n5mlASnBI9LnvCPVPAzEgJG8VFerxjdt/XgSLKyHjMzMDDpWD4/h0ECd/CpOv/Y18\n/ONAKUFfI7wESkoMnKvXeS3vD7wPov2nv/fhjEPo10rofbcJgb36hY/3MWlX8z7U\nAIh1wwDzAUv7aFTrFxgmnaBTep01B0REKxwe1t8sXSH5FHAME/nMslw2DEZESXF9\ns4PpqHMjtUmz2EmVLSc7pkFCG7Enjqbtim2H/W0g5hlpxJ41NopBSLEN2M8QWvts\nRxUdBZTMNJryiq8nIqenbdshts5KJZsRWd5jQ7nSjeSqbIbvyQQiguSxq8lxFu8z\nZU3gloxyrOVDHGYH9aQK0OPw5mNpX56LdYPZfkh+0lwrXwzwG9CNbPW6oZ8E9H+U\n7amGRqSN2oZ1LzFabMGGvf18wUR5Odtd/LHV5h4NPEb1grKRzDcdq21O5IBg8ET0\neONUHmX6rCeHMPtEp8evX7uHTbmyLj9ZGp63TL1gL0K+oO7DKVmRXkx8lo8TlO8k\nI33U6tlF50+qawLIz34F\n=hdhW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fe0ce18ef607f7d5ee27ede8cb069e154da74b43\nparent 217b9eb372fa51b0439434f31abc3ac22e6cd7f2\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1786626714 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786626714 -0400\n\nchore(evals): track the unversioned harbor-index dataset (#5467)\n\nThe autonomous category and the `harbor.yml` dataset dropdown pin\n`harbor-index/harbor-index-1.0`, a frozen one-revision package, so runs\nnever pick up index updates.","verified_at":"2026-08-13T13:11:58Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/8d4cabc23585bc35fb10da9049c150e3e35e460e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8d4cabc23585bc35fb10da9049c150e3e35e460e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repo