 helps distinguish multiple questions.\nShared padding keeps active and inactive questions aligned while\ninactive dimming still communicates navigation state.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/59f5b894-b153-a1c4-7c99-0e8309efcb8b)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d9574786ad8bb077b04822887588c4c267f1bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5d9574786ad8bb077b04822887588c4c267f1bb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/78a48111d743354a4da95650407c66a383691716","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfRPvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgGEQADYEau3oJsIgDe2TLZkCd4Gq\npxY5wqNKhR5lFq6aHKezZwJELZ6F8jfEmJszP+gGevGfwW8ZkHUimGiLB87i8gbH\nS+bXKdzkNN0INKKGU6fmbh9LSHeUqRs3ytG6fNe78ZFhNmz4YjOlQD1joYz8LhBA\nYDWkTLz67TQn4sTxPza9Scibb/R7XI6eCseaUo8i8GNZbjOHu0n7M8LtmPM4rhZz\nbn4wG2Ye8Cr1DXa8i0R+fBdLZAIFbE3WVrAPPf2z6bmTiQhruMzoPaS6FRi3tbTq\nd4rcl+I3fUDm6MhEjpD2RjsLrDxWLdgFzJeN8SZyANqvHXH+BH9XXd5FLO1OGnbC\n87ugXWCdY4nMSmFsOAe35tmw45fw8cHG1/9WoGBiTqOlySaXHdzrcqsprzxKHUQ9\n1EIY8j1NqkJZhXbJfNesOAkyy9YJRdnPfOER3zn1DIIKcNEhn0wGU2/qXxwo4R8S\nHjRfyskKlmU8qWUrgr//X9InwcFwhpYxrG7bzvV2nhO8926FjY+vyT20mUgZ9KHH\nUFQXsvfQRXVEgcHxFh22xvn3mIaqWVNi05xnOilOu4lGWe4vo0tYBL9RHpABcKwI\nURznGTrOQTpmvQpVdDL42GfOZavYwrglyEL8k1L+iuF9mp4ac5OjGzJc8jARPKtQ\nKpJ+3yYko5NhrwBfTzhv\n=vPMZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5d9574786ad8bb077b04822887588c4c267f1bb7\nparent b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786581999 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786581999 -0700\n\nstyle(code): simplify `ask_user` question presentation (#5444)\n\nSingle-question `ask_user` prompts no longer repeat a `1.` label, and\nactive questions no longer show a left-side highlight bar.\n\n---\n\nThe prompt title already conveys singular versus plural context, so\nnumbering remains only when it helps distinguish multiple questions.\nShared padding keeps active and inactive questions aligned while\ninactive dimming still communicates navigation state.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/59f5b894-b153-a1c4-7c99-0e8309efcb8b)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-13T00:46:42Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/78a48111d743354a4da95650407c66a383691716","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/78a48111d743354a4da95650407c66a383691716","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/78a48111d743354a4da95650407c66a383691716/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394"}]},{"sha":"b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI3MmIzZGQ3MmUwYTMxOTYyZWJmMTkyNjFkYmE1NDc0NjJiNGUzOTQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-13T00:46:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-13T00:46:09Z"},"message":"feat(code): personalize external editor hints (#5445)\n\nEditor hints now name the configured `$VISUAL` or `$EDITOR`, while\nunsafe values and platform defaults retain generic wording.\n\n---\n\nDisplay names are resolved and validated at render time so in-session\nenvironment changes are reflected without exposing odd terminal content.\nThe `/editor` registry description remains static because it also feeds\nmachine-generated documentation and import-time autocomplete metadata.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `make format`; `make lint`; 152 focused editor, TUI, app, and registry\ntests\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/460d7a5f-24f3-4534-5ef2-693874380ab4)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/460d7a5f-24f3-4534-5ef2-693874380ab4/plan\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"155fe67956669e23e7153824f313208cddd9a6f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/155fe67956669e23e7153824f313208cddd9a6f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b72b3dd72e0a31962ebf19261dba547462b4e394","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfRPRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA46UQALIkBIJNwIRo8NPVycWsRalh\nJVj+SIht3ZtCnqbNxfvSO0LkcLCmyL0HX5gl2+TBsQHfGRbNYKTBShR/DmgievXp\nzs3wfmb4ubaUZa/pHJ8eMUNRd0Z6QVkjkuYL8Yqsy3EoqvYwIcFOwiX1E8qABUeC\ngyWyGAicw8Vvc8S4FZJ0KWcerA79/5WaAnKU8O5PU1n1Rezp+qRp3W453ePUYEkp\nPLY47YLsU1fTjox5ije+zHZdC/f9UMpBnQRM/pSqesHNW042FC34KV6RDbgX1Jyl\n6ApRg9ibcSB9F+cbxN8uMhqPwnRRoxX8b/+IKQ4d6fTEFXa1Yicn1a6zC1nU93Xl\n1roMlhN77GW/DqHtR1v7vGVvIBVV6GC+6gnsUNPsnpuESZf9u9jDcnMqs1pGt4RB\ncSpFSVnp8/ZHuvgVtyZ3pgL//ahvIgG0XB6jVBzV+teS6xt2szdXdEE97UX5W7a9\nCmWCsv/exqBkFO4UUHo8IEY0iIimZmL2Brfrwpw7odz4krJRLz9d8rtfVUbW8pKh\n6tmdqSa7xhaQTygyhxQpLEQMJmLgtlTVMgjoRUr4Q2i/meS2WbZxLKfalcfXsCFl\nVYtmGkKWHBJrE0gsiWBXnMoZjVOwX67Bo55N8PWspFijHf3islcM+ZPh4Q6PYVLh\ndCw/rRuIrvf2opJ8/isL\n=Svt8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 155fe67956669e23e7153824f313208cddd9a6f9\nparent c43919c5c05643d03cf00009339cd0e4d3c17d6d\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786581969 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786581969 -0700\n\nfeat(code): personalize external editor hints (#5445)\n\nEditor hints now name the configured `$VISUAL` or `$EDITOR`, while\nunsafe values and platform defaults retain generic wording.\n\n---\n\nDisplay names are resolved and validated at render time so in-session\nenvironment changes are reflected without exposing odd terminal content.\nThe `/editor` registry description remains static because it also feeds\nmachine-generated documentation and import-time autocomplete metadata.