e26fa117d042cf4b441c3e095ddce8e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfJhFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQowQAHeo+zF4uosMFm/kOTjNsT4t\n8yFfg1GjIrM/cnHWlkCo5rG12mGErcTV2KPzWO+AgCKVXymk+8LIK9x6sxQ1vaIs\nDW35b5UGcvco7mWtxSbQkvDaIlm6TIzfn1oTA3VxKP3Ul0hNf3WP4puERZlPns2K\nkFZfcU9RCLQtlkG/pVvhJk12UgeV2DpuySCaeAeZX3DYk4xuazIFFw1DRMGLehnE\n9JIIluqDMO6C0ZObUf1WBj+BXJCWAIgR1CpNewYB3MSiGSUNaZ/QUiScPRUnKjOD\nmMvljl80keVKJ/JmHhFmReiuSn/MRYMoHklluJEZPxk1uOC5CB3UVoZp7nqBcBiu\njcO/q2A0ctCdkYVFNP+abYqYrQCTtHH3W04LTJ9TlaPUmvoNgx+FBjd6CnX1zNXy\nYNty8oW025QodLC0MNLWCErjEphHIHUivDvPpIPhebsLkcDAqFeMV+omjIyGFPEj\ngLxxmhqMrbC5d90twIrpI/OSFWHSd9DvJsIp4ANKJ7PMY52tTq0lcFnh4WrBVlqs\nid9b0aV1oN+c6InN5FJ6nJ16Hx+7l7xZlzoKMKRW6m8dZbKgE8LXL+cxanK/QtRX\n3CRP6iMfBKTrGcorZJAZma0tKJ8WEiw8yLT4p1krDKfIUPwGOec1DmGM9iO9nXGy\nryANFcQGoreOGTC5qxJQ\n=7q+G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ae8f4aa15116c2fc95c761d2d0cd7e80636e2122\nparent a78d7b1744050c3221aab5e0c0300cc5f5bec519\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1786550341 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786550341 -0700\n\nstyle(code): color-code cache hit rate (#5436)\n\nRelated #5408\n\nCache hit rates in the status footer now use muted, warning, and error\ncolors so low cache reuse is easy to spot.\n\n---\n\nThe follow-up styling remained as an uncommitted working-tree diff when\nthe original status-row PR merged. This reapplies that isolated change\non current `main`, with boundary coverage for the 60% and 90%\nthresholds.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-12T15:59:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9be99efb1e26fa117d042cf4b441c3e095ddce8e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9be99efb1e26fa117d042cf4b441c3e095ddce8e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9be99efb