ic","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7"}]},{"sha":"22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDIyYTM2ZDI1ZDllODI5MDJmYTI4Y2RhY2RjYjUxY2Q2YTliMDEzZDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-11T23:17:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-11T23:17:40Z"},"message":"feat(code): persist and reconfigure ACP sessions (#5366)\n\nDepends on #5365\n\n`dcode --acp` sessions now survive process restarts and can switch among\ndiscovered models without losing checkpointed context.\n\n---\n\nACP mode now keeps dcode’s SQLite checkpointer open, builds each session\nfor its cwd and selected model, and advertises the installed model\ncatalog through `session/set_config_option`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=../acp:../deepagents:. .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q\ntests/unit_tests/test_main_acp_mode.py`\n- Ruff and `ty` checks for the changed files\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019fdd2c-6961-769a-95e8-e808b66d23d4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa97440dbe49bdb798b6f2045674434a521c2c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/aa97440dbe49bdb798b6f2045674434a521c2c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe62UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApD0QAEf3RzW/Bo42Q/PuFS6yLMk/\n6thJbUgRDX5peAZZYb8JbR6mAhg+tp3iIC8Bt6Nnz21V4sTNqfu/cPXlYWRQKTYr\n6FqSwOCPZXnnwTDMtbVCmUHAQ/Okh0U8OCd97Yo1ESjFcQKzzJKMEA3DZSbAWf4z\nwLtHFGIO98ko7Ak059h57/Bp/ObjBEZ2DUkmY4hcusdgaskomEslgzzeFn/2/B1e\nlt5Ulfpjn07KDpZjX6arTVQKsAvkZZD4Yo0q8JYg58t9KBndVyK6zOP5qBZsRN6n\nLoIJvsNpcugaeP/EdHC9JhcHkhMPQCHBQgomyxce+jez1iwkJm86focZUWKm/usN\nojX8Aekb2gEyVuTqbcuMCOx33hRVSb4B7aL6APz+bRZlNISPXSE1zMhodU2q1SGB\n/iZDrsVnbwji63ZRx7QVBJY7Wh6eU+4ZCfRMTC4U9M3FNnFlzLt0ZtkP/f9odY8W\nbS8MyoXJnwMUp5iGuNc7K2QQTUpYn0+OK41+n5fAdrvOzh2dKJwCIH0s28V+utDI\n/8qEr3haojisrpHPWb4uw6niOYBPSdgVSZJ0m5issi7EL3ZqiLXpbnFZgnRAqGUz\nX3NwgDRz4R26R+XJH818lCmoLSed0h9sgv5sshKgeGvalmyhZlIbI0GUjklhi+Nv\nD/wBbr3SlB9Z3eY8gkN3\n=Qhsr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree aa97440dbe49bdb798b6f2045674434a521c2c88\nparent 0355416c0d4817ac58d3e14aa8b7ab099b6db74d\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1786490260 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786490260 -0700\n\nfeat(code): persist and reconfigure ACP sessions (#5366)\n\nDepends on #5365\n\n`dcode --acp` sessions now survive process restarts and can switch among\ndiscovered models without losing checkpointed context.\n\n---\n\nACP mode now keeps dcode’s SQLite checkpointer open, builds each session\nfor its cwd and selected model, and advertises the installed model\ncatalog through `session/set_config_option`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=../acp:../deepagents:. .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q\ntests/unit_tests/test_main_acp_mode.py`\n- Ruff and `ty` checks for the changed files\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019fdd2c-6961-769a-95e8-e808b66d23d4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-11T23:17:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/22a36d25d9e82902fa28cdacdcb51cd6a9b013d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/22a36d25d