ngchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a27208d70f94b82eaa0772198d3af270ffff1208","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a27208d70f94b82eaa0772198d3af270ffff1208/comments","author":{"login":"ccurme","id":26529506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTI5NTA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26529506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme","html_url":"https://github.com/ccurme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83"}]},{"sha":"f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGY0ZGExNmU3ZmQ5NjNkNTUxZWE3MmEwNjlhNTJjNjRlMzU5ZWNjODM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-11T18:15:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-11T18:15:22Z"},"message":"chore(code): print live tail command and say \"Upgraded.\" in installer (#5371)\n\nDuring an update, the installer now prints the live `tail -f` command\nfor the install log (e.g. `Update log: tail -f\n~/.cache/deepagents-code/install.log`) so you can watch progress in\nanother terminal, and a successful update ends with `Upgraded.` instead\nof the neutral `Version changed.`.\n\n---\n\nTwo user-visible installer changes:\n\n**Live update-log hint.** Previously uv's output went to a mktemp\nscratch file and was only copied to\n`~/.cache/deepagents-code/install.log` after the install finished, so\nthere was nothing to watch mid-install. Unprivileged runs now stream\nuv's output directly to the persistent log file — matching what the\nbuilt-in updater already does — and the script prints the `tail -f`\ncommand whenever it starts an update.\n\n**\"Upgraded.\" footer.** An unpinned, default-prerelease run that moved\nversions always printed `Version changed.` because the script couldn't\ndistinguish a real upgrade from uv resolving an older package via a\ncustom index. The script now records when it deliberately moved to the\nPyPI latest it had just fetched and confirmed differed from the\ninstalled version, and only that path prints `Upgraded.` — pinned\ndowngrades and custom-index moves stay neutral as before.","tree":{"sha":"4012a0e81ae1cec29e7ee8082cf3d82ef7fb0eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/4012a0e81ae1cec29e7ee8082cf3d82ef7fb0eb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe2a6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAgwQAFhxa4H7w07wh5maz54CwqFA\n5ssKJQn+bb13+2GkBIWDdECcu4MUt01IHfUC72Z9L3bboBWKQb/btU2jGdZt8znR\nfynH/tTdS2QjI6rHLB6r+RD/i/yVH1yU9Z4R+AXr7nUqco98JFQvC23IA9S+zhZG\ntk9Thfh4nxIN/clb88vmgDXhxySJ1wtqZIZ0tVMi3Nf0rnehG/v/hPcubHmTKzz2\nLH8J1U6hienb8mvBUw0c/211VzONVLLca8iC/e1q0qP3PXR+febzd+6BbykKDquL\nl02T3mw0m/YcgEGUzLcsGPHfV4KUetYzAIrl39vOowzQGQooUyQUFVAmtUb20urN\nx14rmBdN78UoVUgZVzKtdNgSkKKmdBT/m9K5Noy74zEgsf7mL9rqzj1MDZwTE8uh\nC0CUx49LrjMdk96ZbZvqtHYuye7rXwEaY1EXX54E7m+hPKmGFC5xovdjPZTP0T9I\nvISO7i0h0LxfIQDBA7+4qRLUHZdqV3HLqKDudwQFrRvCpydIQt350bzVAtzu04wS\nXMBsdqgvo7dZepgJ9DtOrL8Cbg+MuBgppo4pHy2aPxcmvUtaNmc64KqjhSbZNPJC\nV4J7IyGYDu3my4KdI8hCMub0DMuC3XUtLQyzqFp3McNv8sGrmPoMrft3qbg3vLLv\nFta+/w111TO9e/isHsS2\n=scjv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 4012a0e81ae1cec29e7ee8082cf3d82ef7fb0eb7\nparent e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786472122 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786472122 -0700\n\nchore(code): print live tail command and say \"Upgraded.\" in installer (#5371)\n\nDuring an update, the installer now prints the live `tail -f` command\nfor the install log (e.g. `Update log: tail -f\n~/.cache/deepagents-code/install.log`) so you can watch progress in\nanother terminal, and a successful update ends with `Upgraded.` instead\nof the neutral `Version changed.`.\n\n---\n\nTwo user-visible installer changes:\n\n**Live update-log hint.** Previously uv's output went to a mktemp\nscratch file and was only copied to\n`~/.cache/deepagents-code/install.log` after the install finished, so\nthere was nothing to watch mid-install. Unprivileged runs now stream\nuv's output directly to the persistent log file — matching what the\nbuilt-in updater already does — and the script prints the `tail -f`\ncommand whenever it starts an update.\n\n**\"Upgraded.\" footer.** An unpinned, default-prerelease run that moved\nversions always printed `Version changed.` because the script couldn't\ndistinguish a real upgrade from uv resolving an older package via a\ncustom index. The script now records when it deliberately moved to the\nPyPI latest it had just fetched and confirmed differed from the\ninstalled version, and only that path prints `Upgraded.` — pinned\ndowngrades and custom-index moves stay neutral as before.","verified_at":"2026-08-11T18:15:25Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f4da16e7fd963d551ea72a069a52c64e359ecc83/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000"}]},{"sha":"e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU3NDJkMDRjOGNhNmY2MTUzMjdkN2QxZWFiNzk5NGJlOGZjYjMwMDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-11T17:56:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-11T17:56:02Z"},"message":"feat(code): `Ctrl+S` in `/auto model` stores `[models].auto_classifier` (#5313)\n\nCtrl+S in the `/auto model` picker now stores `[models].auto_classifier`\n(previously we overwrote `[models].default`, the model the agent itself\nruns on).\n\n`/goal model` and `/rubric model` pickers disable Ctrl+S entirely, since\ngrader models have no config key to persist (currently).\n\n- The picker and confirmation messages explain when an environment\noverride is currently active, without assuming it will still be set at\nthe next launch.\n- Persistence failures and unavailable provider integrations surface\nactionable feedback.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/d5387427-eb16-90bf-794c-8234fd457186)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf9825befcf023c32f337be1a5be67647e29eb6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cf9825befcf023c32f337be1a5be67647e29eb6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe2IyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAen0QADgm01JyzOs9dPKa0JPUYe9k\ndfW6gabhMtO8wX/QJRiAE6bJLPxsgFIWjq3k2P+guZhTlkC6gAfpJ2ovLoyruP9J\noWIsCEIgKGAx/AifUbbjqVAbUEYsHx3sXe3CV32M3a4NcfqdlJ9IZIWi24ewcKaR\nggR/BM6l1a3M67DsmaZ6GbLaPAkcQIm7cjXmARlRKkbvpdwuXnY9hlh/0eiLpAaB\nsA2HUFlKcmCuq1Zsg+Bpohl+KMQRkafKTm3+LZ9is1IysTtOK1TZPyzC83trY01w\n95HduGizALOdjtQLl2gZer7jpHfJu/d//u07KE/Wdw2ZQzSwdhDwkMvOl9D+rA2Q\nbHj2FoDpKWaOU7pFqLFJHeYeym++f20M9I4YNE8DYjj0lck7mvj2gORqIuJRxP9L\nkOnUz/MEsXAy1Kyqc26RkMkhxN3wmSwoo/9UC2n+cqQ+YrtA1cCVrTMIrfwhiRUt\nRqF0vbqTLbgfzfHNC75zhqyybSNTg9J+Epw7b7npPqLQrjmI1GEnxPRhDC+UxM1f\nlpG6Pm+Ryuw6lkP3NehEghBYmEJgZ9wriHp5RzR2X1exMXAHrf8/UHKdSyexP1EM\ngonnaGYAUJPzutBXsR5UnX0MPRu/R5H14EoJk4CPZD9iAZkKdWvxPrF/yObAYMO/\n5X7LMQFbcTYBXec5QmDR\n=5G7x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cf9825befcf023c32f337be1a5be67647e29eb6c\nparent 524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786470962 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786470962 -0700\n\nfeat(code): `Ctrl+S` in `/auto model` stores `[models].auto_classifier` (#5313)\n\nCtrl+S in the `/auto model` picker now stores `[models].auto_classifier`\n(previously we overwrote `[models].default`, the model the agent itself\nruns on).\n\n`/goal model` and `/rubric model` pickers disable Ctrl+S entirely, since\ngrader models have no config key to persist (currently).\n\n- The picker and confirmation messages explain when an environment\noverride is currently active, without assuming it will still be set at\nthe next launch.\n- Persistence failures and unavailable provider integrations surface\nactionable feedback.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/d5387427-eb16-90bf-794c-8234fd457186)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-11T17:56:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e742d04c8ca6f615327d7d1eab7994be8fcb3000/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60"}]},{"sha":"524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDUyNGFmNDhjYTJkOTIyNGUxMGRlMzhkMjk2Yjc4NGE3ZjA1ZGZkNjA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-11T16:50:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-11T16:50:45Z"},"message":"ci(infra): clear `pending-deletion` when a PR gains `do-not-close` (#5411)\n\nAdding `do-not-close` to a PR with `pending-deletion` now removes the\nstale auto-close warning at once.\n\n---\n\nThe daily cleanup job already removes `pending-deletion` when it finds\n`do-not-close`. This new workflow does the same work when a maintainer\nadds `do-not-close`. It also minimizes the warning comment.\n\n`close-old-prs.js` checks for `do-not-close` before it adds\n`pending-deletion` and before it closes a PR. If the label appears\nduring a run, the script removes `pending-deletion`, minimizes the\nwarning comment, and skips the PR.\n\nThe workflow uses `pull_request_target` so it can update labels on PRs\nfrom forks. It does not check out or run PR code.","tree":{"sha":"d131222684f9130902b81ad9bd40387f26117400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d131222684f9130902b81ad9bd40387f26117400"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe1LlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/eEQAAZXmSa2bG2YNFj7uWBomE40\nfxKpkM/QzGRyJ46Bb9r/r4cyAeGR0QSDaoHI/o9hm9qg0fOpj7pF+JDfcE1MUKJf\nBGcQ1E8U6TQraB4T1aFdNYWgd1TPdYfoLcj0VQKUZ6FT5TMJCGpcw1U2vJMuby6L\nxhfp4INIq6s18UxDQTfy9R34QSEhibUuWuMlTY1wKMbWegV/8VYFlko3tEKPgtAT\nZjthtpg2iefGhT4eWSOfNRBcX/3NK7m0SG04s1VXoDPE/rh8gELCcYZwLQ1dEQjE\nfHoRljnCDhBVB1wvJI1AoNRPO0Vry95NsriyPU597X9bjiayyDYUDPOZqQ+HKPV+\nhmS3fZioRrTZGVFEIQqLj+0TXo8Mc9MT7Fp7Dsq399sPqWr/jTAz9nENpJyWZNZB\n+fIJC6+iVs8mybOdylpc7oZ6GY2MBLMMvcyNJxtLBBbKnhhfLQLskcA8PUsA9dmV\nhhsD2WJK7c8k00tvSeWeqVuY+j/GD3R5+zRKxK7gisELxO1qHghXWnYfDUNRBft3\n8M8shmIVj4ZR1uOWsHDGBkJYlt71ISNKSgsUDHRQGWKjKIt/UKIdO1+Bx+k9d0Wo\nVBdxgbtHDUwIIV01Rc2c+lzIeelgf3XO1Tru01MzZxpUOKeirHpTaaPDOtO9p3mO\nYs4uXfv97sX217XFL+gF\n=cHWC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d131222684f9130902b81ad9bd40387f26117400\nparent f1378978e20f94762601ed38787a6fdb7fb39784\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1786467045 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786467045 -0700\n\nci(infra): clear `pending-deletion` when a PR gains `do-not-close` (#5411)\n\nAdding `do-not-close` to a PR with `pending-deletion` now removes the\nstale auto-close warning at once.\n\n---\n\nThe daily cleanup job already removes `pending-deletion` when it finds\n`do-not-close`. This new workflow does the same work when a maintainer\nadds `do-not-close`. It also minimizes the warning comment.\n\n`close-old-prs.js` checks for `do-not-close` before it adds\n`pending-deletion` and before it closes a PR. If the label appears\nduring a run, the script removes `pending-deletion`, minimizes the\nwarning comment, and skips the PR.\n\nThe workflow uses `pull_request_target` so it can update labels on PRs\nfrom forks. It does not check out or run PR code.","verified_at":"2026-08-11T16:50:48Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/524af48ca2d9224e10de38d296b784a7f05dfd60/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f1378978e20f94762601ed38787a6fdb7fb39784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f1378978e20f94762601ed38787a6fdb7fb39784","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f1378978e20f94762601ed38787a6fdb7fb39784"}]}]